# ==========================================
# Docker Build & Git Globals
# ==========================================
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github
README.md
Docker*

# ==========================================
# Python (Django, Flask, FastAPI, etc.)
# ==========================================
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/.mypy_cache/

# Environments (Virtualenvs)
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/ENV/
**/env/

# ==========================================
# JavaScript / React / Vue (Node ecosystem)
# ==========================================
**/node_modules/
**/.npm/
**/.eslintcache
**/.prettiercache

# Build Outputs (React & Vue defaults)
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/out/

# Log Files
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# ==========================================
# Environment Variables & Secrets (CRITICAL)
# ==========================================
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/auth.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# ==========================================
# IDE & System Files
# ==========================================
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.suo
**/*.ntvs*
**/*.njsproj
**/*.sln
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
